# Uploaded receipts, invoices and statements. Never in git: they carry customer
# addresses and bank details, and a repo is the wrong place for either.
#
# Anchored to the one directory that holds them. A bare `documents/` matches at
# EVERY depth, which silently excluded frontend/src/app/admin/documents — the
# whole UI for this feature — from being committed at all.
/backend/documents/
*.mp4
